## Interface: 11200
## Title: Equadis' OmniBars
## Version: 0.1.0
## Author: Equadis
## Notes: All-in-one interface package. In development: the combat HUD is the first module set.
## X-Website: https://github.com/eqomdx/EquadisOmniBars
## SavedVariables: EquadisOmniBarsDB

# The load order is the dependency graph. There is no loader: each file picks the
# namespace up as a file local and may only use what came before it.

# foundation
core.lua
config.lua

# rendering and placement
render.lua
layout.lua

# driver
hud.lua

# modules -- they register themselves, and this order is also the panel order
modules\power.lua
modules\combopoints.lua
modules\swing.lua
modules\health.lua

# interface
options.lua
slash.lua
